    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence1-17",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "年十一而孤，特爲高祖所愛，衣服禮秩與正王不殊。",
      "reading": "十一歲失父，祖父梁武帝愛之，待遇同正王。",
      "note": "十一歲失父，祖父梁武帝愛之，待遇同正王。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 17,
      "end_codepoint": 40,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence1-40",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "年十五，拜輕車將軍、湘州刺史，又領石頭戍軍事。",
      "reading": "十五歲拜湘州刺史等職。",
      "note": "十五歲拜湘州刺史等職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 40,
      "end_codepoint": 63,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence1-63",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "遷侍中，兼領軍將軍。",
      "reading": "遷侍中兼領軍。",
      "note": "遷侍中兼領軍。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 63,
      "end_codepoint": 73,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence1-73",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "尋除宣惠將軍、丹陽尹，置佐史。",
      "reading": "尋為丹陽尹等職。",
      "note": "尋為丹陽尹等職。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 73,
      "end_codepoint": 88,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence1-88",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "出爲使持節、都督南北兗北徐青冀東徐譙七州諸軍事、平北將軍、南兗州刺史。",
      "reading": "出為使持節、都督七州諸軍事、南兗州刺史。",
      "note": "出為使持節、都督七州諸軍事、南兗州刺史。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 88,
      "end_codepoint": 123,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence1-123",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "太清元年，督衆軍北討，至彭城，爲魏師所敗，退歸本鎮。",
      "reading": "太清元年攻魏敗於彭城，退回本鎮。",
      "note": "太清元年攻魏敗於彭城，退回本鎮。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p001",
      "start_codepoint": 123,
      "end_codepoint": 149,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-0",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "二年，侯景圍京邑，會理治嚴將入援，會北徐州刺史封山侯正表將應其兄正德，外託赴援，實謀襲廣陵，會理擊破之。",
      "reading": "太清二年侯景圍京，會理先破擬應兄蕭正德的蕭正表。",
      "note": "太清二年侯景圍京，會理先破擬應兄蕭正德的蕭正表。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 0,
      "end_codepoint": 52,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-52",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "方得進路，臺城陷，侯景遣前臨江太守董紹先以高祖手敕召會理，其僚佐咸勸距之。",
      "reading": "臺城陷後，董紹先奉梁武帝手敕召會理，僚佐勸阻。",
      "note": "臺城陷後，董紹先奉梁武帝手敕召會理，僚佐勸阻。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 52,
      "end_codepoint": 89,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-89",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "會理曰：「諸君心事，與我不同，天子年尊，受制賊虜，今有手敕召我入朝，臣子之心，豈得違背。",
      "reading": "會理向僚佐說明入京決定，天子指梁武帝。",
      "note": "會理向僚佐說明入京決定，天子指梁武帝。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 89,
      "end_codepoint": 133,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-133",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "且遠處江北，功業難成，不若身赴京都，圖之肘腋。",
      "reading": "續述遠處江北，難圖反正。",
      "note": "續述遠處江北，難圖反正。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 133,
      "end_codepoint": 156,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-156",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "吾計決矣。」",
      "reading": "以「吾計決矣」作結。",
      "note": "以「吾計決矣」作結。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 156,
      "end_codepoint": 162,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-162",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "遂席捲而行，以城輸紹先。",
      "reading": "將城交董紹先，入京。",
      "note": "將城交董紹先，入京。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 162,
      "end_codepoint": 174,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-174",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "至京，景以爲侍中、司空、兼中書令。",
      "reading": "侯景任會理為侍中、司空、兼中書令。南史此處作司空兼尚書令。",
      "note": "侯景任會理為侍中、司空、兼中書令。南史此處作司空兼尚書令。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 174,
      "end_codepoint": 191,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-191",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "雖在寇手，每思匡復，與西鄉侯勸等潛布腹心，要結壯士。",
      "reading": "會理與西鄉侯勸等密謀匡復。",
      "note": "會理與西鄉侯勸等密謀匡復。",
      "paragraph_id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:p002",
      "start_codepoint": 191,
      "end_codepoint": 217,
      "human_reviewed": false
    },
    {
      "id": "c-liangshu-029-huili-complete:received_sentence2-217",
      "kind": "received_sentence",
      "person_id": "fo7_f8v_rmf_CA",
      "source_quote": "時范陽祖皓斬紹先，據廣陵城起義，期以會理爲內應。",
